{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25278","headline":"题开元寺牡丹 · 徐凝","name":"题开元寺牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此花南地知难种，惭愧僧闲用意栽。\n海燕解怜频睥睨，胡蜂未识更徘徊。\n虚生芍药徒劳妒，羞杀玫瑰不敢开。\n惟有数苞红蕚在，含芳只待舍人来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25278.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25278","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}